(   [Problem Statement]: Draw the orthographic projections of the following six points on a single common XY reference line with projector spacing of 30 mm: Point A \(25 mm above HP, 35 mm in front of VP\); Point B \(30 mm above HP, 40 mm behind VP\); Point C \(40 mm below HP, 25 mm behind VP\); Point D \(35 mm below HP, 30 mm in front of VP\); Point E \(in HP, 40 mm in front of VP\); Point F \(30 mm above HP, in VP\).) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step-by-Step Construction Procedure:) Tj
T*
(   1. Reference Line Setup:) Tj
T*
(   - Draw a continuous thin horizontal reference line XY of length 200 mm across the drawing) Tj
T*
(   sheet.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Point A \(1st Quadrant: 25 mm above HP, 35 mm in front of VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - Draw a vertical projector perpendicular to XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view a' at 25 mm ABOVE XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view a at 35 mm BELOW XY.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Point B \(2nd Quadrant: 30 mm above HP, 40 mm behind VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - At 30 mm to the right of projector A, draw second vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view b' at 30 mm ABOVE XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view b at 40 mm ABOVE XY \(both views lie above XY\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Point C \(3rd Quadrant: 40 mm below HP, 25 mm behind VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - At 30 mm to the right of projector B, draw third vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view c' at 40 mm BELOW XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view c at 25 mm ABOVE XY.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Point D \(4th Quadrant: 35 mm below HP, 30 mm in front of VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - At 30 mm to the right of projector C, draw fourth vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view d' at 35 mm BELOW XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view d at 30 mm BELOW XY \(both views lie below XY\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   6. Point E \(In HP, 40 mm in front of VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - At 30 mm to the right of projector D, draw fifth vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view e' directly ON the XY line \(height = 0\).) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view e at 40 mm BELOW XY.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   7. Point F \(30 mm above HP, In VP\):) Tj
T*
(   - At 30 mm to the right of projector E, draw sixth vertical projector.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark front view f' at 30 mm ABOVE XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Mark top view f directly ON the XY line \(distance from VP = 0\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
