T*
(   - Top View \(ab\): A single point \(a coincides with b\) located at distance in front of VP.) Tj
T*
(   - Horizontal Trace \(HT\): Coincides with the point top view \(ab\). No Vertical Trace \(VT\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
