T*
(   - Front View \(a'b'\): A single point \(a' coincides with b'\) located at height above HP.) Tj
T*
(   - Top View \(ab\): A line perpendicular to XY showing TRUE LENGTH \(TL\).) Tj
T*
(   - Vertical Trace \(VT\): Coincides with the point front view \(a'b'\). No Horizontal Trace \(HT\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
