T*
(   - Front View \(a'b'\): Inclined at angle theta to XY showing TRUE LENGTH \(TL\).) Tj
T*
(   - Top View \(ab\): Parallel to XY showing FORESHORTENED length: ab = TL * cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
(   - Horizontal Trace \(HT\): Exists \(extends front view to XY\); No Vertical Trace \(VT\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
