T*
(   - Top View \(ab\): Inclined at angle phi to XY showing TRUE LENGTH \(TL\).) Tj
T*
(   - Front View \(a'b'\): Parallel to XY showing FORESHORTENED length: a'b' = TL * cos\(phi\).) Tj
T*
(   - Vertical Trace \(VT\): Exists; No Horizontal Trace \(HT\).) Tj
