BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
45 780 Td
(   - Distance between projectors Delta X = 50 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - True Length \(TL\):) Tj
T*
(   TL = sqrt\( \(Delta X\)^2 + \(Delta Y\)^2 + \(Delta Z\)^2 \)) Tj
T*
(   TL = sqrt\( 50^2 + 45^2 + 45^2 \) = sqrt\( 2500 + 2025 + 2025 \) = sqrt\( 6550 \) = 80.93 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - True inclination with HP \(theta\):) Tj
T*
(   sin\(theta\) = Delta Z / TL = 45 / 80.93 = 0.5560 => theta = 33.78 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   - True inclination with VP \(phi\):) Tj
T*
(   sin\(phi\) = Delta Y / TL = 45 / 80.93 = 0.5560 => phi = 33.78 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   - Apparent lengths:) Tj
T*
(   EL \(front view p'q'\) = sqrt\( \(Delta X\)^2 + \(Delta Z\)^2 \) = sqrt\( 50^2 + 45^2 \) = sqrt\( 4525 \) =) Tj
T*
(   67.27 mm.) Tj
T*
(   PL \(top view pq\) = sqrt\( \(Delta X\)^2 + \(Delta Y\)^2 \) = sqrt\( 50^2 + 45^2 \) = sqrt\( 4525 \) =) Tj
T*
(   67.27 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Trace Locations:) Tj
T*
(   - Horizontal Trace \(HT\):) Tj
T*
(   Slope of front view m_fv = Delta Z / Delta X = 45 / 50 = 0.9.) Tj
T*
(   Distance from P to XY intersection h': x_h = 20 / 0.9 = 22.22 mm to the left of P.) Tj
T*
(   At x = -22.22 mm, y_ht = y_p - 0.9 * 22.22 = 25 - 20 = 5 mm in front of VP.) Tj
T*
(   HT is located 5.0 mm in front of VP and 22.22 mm to the left of projector P.) Tj
T*
(   - Vertical Trace \(VT\):) Tj
T*
(   Distance from P to XY intersection v: x_v = 25 / 0.9 = 27.78 mm to the left of P.) Tj
T*
(   At x = -27.78 mm, z_vt = z_p - 0.9 * 27.78 = 20 - 25 = -5 mm \(below HP\).) Tj
T*
(   VT is located 5.0 mm below HP and 27.78 mm to the left of projector P.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
