T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. CIRCLE Command Options Overview:) Tj
T*
(   - Command: CIRCLE \(or 'C' [Enter]\)) Tj
T*
(   - Prompts: 'Specify center point for circle or [3P/2P/Ttr \(tan tan radius\)]:') Tj
