T*
(   * Prompts for two points defining the opposite ends of a diameter.) Tj
T*
(   * Example: Snapping to midpoints of two parallel lines constructs a perfectly tangent bounded) Tj
T*
(   circle.) Tj
T*
(   - 3-Point \(3P\):) Tj
T*
(   * Prompts for three distinct non-collinear boundary points on the circumference.) Tj
T*
(   * Example: Passing a pitch circle through three drilled hole centers on a flange.) Tj
T*
(   - Tan, Tan, Radius \(TTR\):) Tj
T*
(   * Prompts to select two existing entities \(lines, circles\) to which the new circle will be) Tj
T*
(   tangent, then prompts for radius.) Tj
T*
(   * Example: Constructing a fillet blend between two non-intersecting pipe outlines.) Tj
T*
(   - Tan, Tan, Tan \(TTT\):) Tj
T*
(   * Available via Ribbon flyout \(executes 3P with three deferred Tangent snaps\).) Tj
T*
(   * Inscribes a circle perfectly inside a triangle tangent to all three sides.) Tj
