(   1. Geometric Structure of Ellipse in AutoCAD:) Tj
T*
(   - AutoCAD represents ellipses as exact mathematical NURBS curves \(Non-Uniform Rational) Tj
T*
(   B-Splines\).) Tj
T*
(   - Major Axis \(2a\): The longest diameter passing through the center.) Tj
T*
(   - Minor Axis \(2b\): The shortest diameter perpendicular to major axis.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Command Execution Options:) Tj
T*
(   - Axis, End \(Default\):) Tj
T*
(   * Prompts: 'Specify axis endpoint of ellipse:' -> Pick P1.) Tj
T*
(   * 'Specify other endpoint of axis:' -> Pick P2 \(Defines major or minor axis vector 2a\).) Tj
T*
(   * 'Specify distance to other axis:' -> Enter distance 'b' \(semi-minor axis length measured) Tj
T*
(   perpendicularly from axis midpoint\).) Tj
T*
(   - Center \(C\):) Tj
T*
(   * Prompts: 'Specify center of ellipse:' -> Pick C.) Tj
T*
(   * 'Specify endpoint of axis:' -> Pick endpoint defining first semi-axis 'a'.) Tj
T*
(   * 'Specify distance to other axis:' -> Enter length of second semi-axis 'b'.) Tj
T*
(   - Elliptical Arc \(A\):) Tj
T*
(   * Constructs an ellipse as above, then prompts for 'Start angle' and 'End angle' to generate a) Tj
T*
(   partial elliptical segment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Isometric Circle Construction \(Isocircle\):) Tj
T*
(   - In 2D isometric drafting \(ISODRAFT active, F5 toggling planes\):) Tj
T*
(   - Execute ELLIPSE -> Type 'I' \(Isocircle\) [Enter].) Tj
T*
(   - Prompts: Specify center of isocircle -> Specify radius.) Tj
T*
(   - AutoCAD automatically calculates the correct 35?16' projection tilt and draws the isometric) Tj
T*
