T*
(   3. Mathematical Computation of True Length:) Tj
T*
(   - Delta X = 45 mm) Tj
T*
(   - Delta Y = 0 - 25 = -25 mm) Tj
T*
(   - Delta Z = 40 - 0 = 40 mm) Tj
T*
(   - True Length TL = sqrt\( \(Delta X\)^2 + \(Delta Y\)^2 + \(Delta Z\)^2 \)) Tj
T*
(   TL = sqrt\( 45^2 + 25^2 + 40^2 \) = sqrt\( 2025 + 625 + 1600 \) = sqrt\( 4250 \) = 65.19 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. True Inclinations:) Tj
T*
(   - Angle with HP \(theta\):) Tj
T*
(   sin\(theta\) = Delta Z / TL = 40 / 65.19 = 0.6136 => theta = 37.85 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   - Angle with VP \(phi\):) Tj
T*
(   sin\(phi\) = Delta Y / TL = 25 / 65.19 = 0.3835 => phi = 22.55 degrees.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Apparent Lengths:) Tj
T*
(   - Elevation Length EL \(a'b'\) = sqrt\( 45^2 + 40^2 \) = sqrt\( 3625 \) = 60.21 mm.) Tj
T*
(   - Plan Length PL \(ab\) = sqrt\( 45^2 + 25^2 \) = sqrt\( 2650 \) = 51.48 mm.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
