(>> Solution to Question 30:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Summarize the comprehensive engineering protocol for solving line projection problems, from problem statement interpretation to final drawing validation.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Systematic Engineering Protocol for Line Projections:) Tj
T*
(   1. Parse Given Parameters:) Tj
T*
(   - Identify which of the 12 fundamental variables are given:) Tj
T*
(   * True Length \(TL\), True inclinations \(theta, phi\)) Tj
T*
(   * Elevation Length \(EL\), Plan Length \(PL\)) Tj
T*
(   * Apparent angles \(alpha, beta\)) Tj
T*
(   * Distance between projectors \(D\)) Tj
T*
(   * Coordinate locations of ends A and B \(zA, yA, zB, yB\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Check Geometric Consistency:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify theta + phi <= 90 degrees.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify apparent angles exceed true angles: alpha >= theta and beta >= phi.) Tj
T*
(   - Verify EL = TL * cos\(phi\) and PL = TL * cos\(theta\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Establish Coordinate Framework:) Tj
T*
(   - Draw reference line XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Plot the fixed end projector \(e.g. a' and a\).) Tj
T*
(   - Draw horizontal locus lines for the second end:) Tj
T*
(   * Locus of b' at distance zB from XY.) Tj
T*
(   * Locus of b at distance yB from XY.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Apply Solution Method:) Tj
T*
(   - Rotating Line Method: Rotate true length rays to locus lines or rotate plan/elevation to) Tj
T*
(   parallel-to-XY orientation.) Tj
T*
(   - Trapezoid / Auxiliary Plane Method for complex spatial clearances.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. Final Verification & Quality Audit:) Tj
T*
(   - Verify that final elevation point b' and plan point b lie on the EXACT SAME vertical) Tj
T*
(   projector perpendicular to XY.) Tj
T*
(   - Dimension true lengths using DIMALIGNED and angles using DIMANGULAR.) Tj
T*
(   - Ensure layer assignments: Outlines on 'Visible' \(0.5 mm\), Construction and locus lines on) Tj
T*
(   'Thin' \(0.25 mm\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET

endstream
